# L2-DEC-017 rounding parity, case 2 of 2. The records of
# standard-timestamps.hex with counter values 0xFFFFFFFE then 0xFFFFFFFF.
# At --standard-tick-rate-hz 0.9 these are 4772185882222222 and the odd
# 4772185883333333 us, both between 2^52 and 2^53, where doubles are
# spaced 1 apart: x + 0.5 is a tie that rounds to even, so floor(x + 0.5)
# -- the C++ form before this case -- put the second 1 us high and DELTA
# read 1.111112 instead of 1.111111.

